---
import logoLightUrl from "../../../assets/logo.svg?url";
import logoDarkUrl from "../../../assets/logo-dark.svg?url";

const repoUrl = "https://github.com/mgzwarrior/mgz-pkmn";
const discussionsUrl = "https://github.com/mgzwarrior/mgz-pkmn/discussions";
---

<section
  id="why"
  class="border-b border-sand-300 dark:border-husk-200/80 px-6 py-20 sm:py-24"
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
    <p
      class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-sand-300 bg-sand-100 backdrop-blur px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-coconut-500 dark:border-husk-50 dark:bg-husk-200/60 dark:text-sand-200"
    >
      <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-palm-400 dark:bg-sun-300"></span>
      From the maker
    </p>

    <h2
      class="mt-6 text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-coconut-700 dark:text-sand-50 text-balance"
    >
      Why I built this.
    </h2>

    <div
      class="mt-6 space-y-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-coconut-500 dark:text-sand-200"
    >
      <p>
        I'm Matt — a collector, not a company. mgz-pkmn started as a tool for
        exactly one person: me, trying to walk into a card show with a plan
        instead of a phone full of half-loaded comp pages.
      </p>
      <p>
        I build it around the rest of life — a full-time job, a new baby, and the
        hours that are left after both. So it grows in small, honest steps. I'd
        rather ship something real and admit what's missing than promise you the
        moon and quietly under-deliver.
      </p>
      <p>
        If you collect too, that's who this is for. It's MIT-licensed and built
        out in the open, and the fastest way to shape where it goes is to tell me
        what you wish it did.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
      <a
        href={repoUrl}
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-md border border-sand-300 bg-sand-100 backdrop-blur px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-coconut-700 hover:bg-sand-200 hover:border-sand-400 dark:border-husk-50 dark:bg-husk-200/60 dark:text-sand-50 dark:hover:bg-husk-100 dark:hover:border-coconut-400 transition"
      >
        See the code
      </a>
      <a
        href={discussionsUrl}
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm font-semibold text-palm-500 hover:text-palm-400 dark:text-sun-300 dark:hover:text-sun-200"
      >
        Tell me what's missing →
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 flex items-center gap-3 border-t border-sand-300 pt-6 dark:border-husk-200/80">
      <img src={logoLightUrl} alt="" width="120" height="30" class="h-6 w-auto dark:hidden" />
      <img src={logoDarkUrl} alt="" width="120" height="30" class="hidden h-6 w-auto dark:block" />
      <span class="text-sm text-coconut-400 dark:text-sand-300">
        A personal project — not a startup. Honest about pace, warm to everyone.
      </span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
